                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\int_0^1\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\,dx&\\approx\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}}{2}\\left[1+0+2\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}4+\\frac{\\sqrt3}2+\\frac{\\sqrt7}4\\right)\\right]\\\\&=\\frac{2+\\sqrt{15}+2\\sqrt3+\\sqrt7}{16}\\\\&\\approx0.7489\\quad\\text{(4 d.p.)}\\end{aligned}",
